      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 用两种方法（利用根的公式和不用公式）解下列不完全的",
        "二次方程：",
        "а) $2x^2+15x=0$；　б) $25x^2-144=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 把下列方程写成$ax^2+bx+c=0$的形式并求解：",
        "а) $3(x+4)^2=10x+32$；　б) $31x+17=15(x+1)^2$；",
        "в) $\\frac{x^2-1}{2}-11x=11$；　г) $\\frac{x^2+x}{2}=\\frac{8x-7}{3}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 不解方程，求方程的两个根（如果存在的话）的和与积：",
        "а) $10x^2-9x+2=0$；　б) $x^2+48x+11=0$；",
        "в) $7x^2-56x+20=0$；　г) $4x^2+x-8=0$；",
        "д) $10x^2-59x=0$；　е) $5x^2-58=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "6",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6. 求下列方程根的集合：",
        "а) $\\frac{x}{x+4}+\\frac{4}{x-4}=\\frac{20}{x^2-16}$；　б) $\\frac{2x}{x+5}-\\frac{5}{5-x}=\\frac{25}{x^2-25}$；",
        "в) $\\frac{x}{x-3}+\\frac{4}{x+3}=\\frac{18}{x^2-9}$；",
        "г) $\\frac{5}{x-1}+\\frac{3x-3}{2(x+1)}=\\frac{2(x^2+4)}{x^2-1}$."
      ]
    },
